test.yaml:13:29: untrusted input from the variable BODY (github.event.comment.body) is written to $GITHUB_OUTPUT as the record "body=..." and can hold a line break: an attacker who controls it ends the record and adds others, so it sets the other outputs of the step (steps.gate.outputs.*) that later steps trust. write a value without line breaks (validate it, or cut it down with tr -d '\n'), or write it between a delimiter that nobody can guess (delimiter=$(uuidgen); echo "body<<$delimiter" ...; echo "$delimiter") [output-clobbering]
